WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.639
Did you know that Whitebeard used to look
like this?

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:07.000
Or that Big Mom went from this happy little
child to eating her friends alive?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.830
Or that Franky almost joined Gol D. Roger’s
crew as a kid?

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:14.110
Well today we’re gonna look at every single
backstory in One Piece.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:18.119
Staring with the oldest character that we
know of, which is…this elephant?

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:24.270
Well, you see this is actually a highly intelligent
creature, the size of 4 Mount Everests, that

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:28.769
was already alive during the Void Century
and that was the companion of the legendary

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:30.199
character called Joy Boy.

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:34.590
The elephant’s name is Zunesha and what
we know for a fact is, that it committed such

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.040
a terrible crime, that as a punishment, it
has been ordered to walk the oceans for over

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.990
800 years, waiting for the return of Joy Boy.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:47.570
Not only that, but during this extremely long
time, a race of human-like animals called

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:51.160
the Minks, ended up building an entire country
on its back.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:55.480
And speaking of super old characters, we also
can’t wait to learn more about other mysterious

00:00:55.480 --> 00:01:00.751
people from the void century LIKE Joy Boy,
who probably used to have Luffy’s legendary

00:01:00.751 --> 00:01:01.751
devil fruit.

00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:06.330
Or Oden’s Wife Toki, who time traveled to
the future…Or the secret king of the world

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.180
Imu, who seems to have been ruling from the
shadows for all this time.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:14.870
In addition, characters like the Gorosei may
also be from this same time period as well,

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:19.900
so hopefully Oda has a giant backstory prepared
for us to explain the Void Century and all

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.340
of the people who lived and fought during
these lost 100 years.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:27.300
And speaking of giant sized backstories we’re
moving on to these two giants, who are some

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.770
of the oldest characters in One Piece.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.860
Dorry and Broggy are a crazy 160 years old.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:38.010
Both of them grew up on the island of giants
called Elbaf and later formed their own crew

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.479
of giant warriors.

00:01:39.479 --> 00:01:44.020
However, they started a really petty fight
over who had hunted the larger animal and

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.700
so when Luffy and the crew meet them, they’ve
actually been dueling for exactly 100 years.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.840
Which created a lot of trouble for the rest
of their crew.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.030
Because without their captains, the two giants
Oimo and Kashi, were later blackmailed by

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:02.939
the World Government into working for them,
with the government pretending to have captured

00:02:02.939 --> 00:02:03.939
their friends.

00:02:03.939 --> 00:02:08.800
And this guy here, called Hajrudin- he ended
up as a gladiator fighting for the entertainment

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:12.390
of others inside the arena on Dressrosa.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:15.519
Even bigger and older than these giants, though,
was Oars.

00:02:15.519 --> 00:02:23.720
While he lived 500 years ago, this ancient
giant was 159 at the time of his death.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.690
He was a terrible villain called “the Continent
Puller.”

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:32.170
After ravaging lands across the world, he
froze to death in an icy Northern continent,

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.970
waiting for the day that Moria would dig him
up and revive him as a zombie.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:39.519
However, Oars also has a descendant - Little
Oars Jr!

00:02:39.519 --> 00:02:44.560
Little Oars Jr was an ally of Whitebeard and
helped during the Marineford War to free Ace

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.990
because Ace had once gifted him a Straw Hat
from the land of Wano.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:53.600
The first straw hat we’re talking about
today, though, is the oldest onet: Brook.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:57.980
This talking, singing skeleton has one of
the most tragic backstories in all of One

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:58.980
Piece.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:02.800
His crew, the Rumbar Pirates, where friends
with a young whale named Laboon. Little Laboon

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:06.970
loved to hear Brook’s music, but when the
crew entered the Grand Line, they had to leave

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:10.159
Laboon behind, promising they’d meet again
one day.

00:03:10.159 --> 00:03:14.450
After getting stuck in the Florian Triangle,
basically the One Piece version of the infamous

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:18.659
bermuda triangle, his entire crew slowly died
of starvation.

00:03:18.659 --> 00:03:23.620
However, thanks to his Yomi Yomi no Mi, Brook
was revived after death and kept living as

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.620
a skeleton.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:28.560
He was cursed to continue wandering the mists
of the Florian Triangle until he joined the

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.280
Straw Hats.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:33.909
Thankfully even death couldn’t get rid of
that sweet sweet afro.

00:03:33.909 --> 00:03:36.810
Up next is the former Fleet Admiral of the
Marines, Sengoku.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:41.800
While he’s now carefree and living his best
life in retirement, we know from this childhood

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:45.200
drawing that Oda made that he was actually
very disciplined.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:50.610
He can be seen here practicing his calligraphy,
preparing him for a long career of filing

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.159
paperwork for Garp.

00:03:52.159 --> 00:03:56.760
On the other hand, this childhood drawing
of Monkey D. Garp gives a very different impression:

00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:01.620
Garp is Luffy’s grandpa and we can definitely
see the resemblance to Luffy because Garp

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.989
absolutely looks more like a pirate as a kid.

00:04:04.989 --> 00:04:08.300
This wild child would grow up to be the Hero
of the Marines.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:13.129
He took down terrible criminals like Don Chinjao,
whose head he punched so hard it went from

00:04:13.129 --> 00:04:14.700
being pointy to round.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:19.390
Don Chinjao would never forgive him for ruining
his perfect spiky head and would try to carry

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.930
out the grudge against Garp’s grandson,
Luffy.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:27.190
Garp also had a friendly rivalry with the
pirate king, Gol D. Roger.

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:30.630
This pair of frenemies teamed up at God Valley
to fight the Rocks pirates.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:34.030
we don’t know anything about his past or
where he came from.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:39.490
All we know, is that Rocks D. Xebec had collected
a crew of some of the most powerful pirates

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.740
in the world.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.430
Legendary characters like Whitebeard.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:43.430
Big Mom.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.430
Kaidou.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.430
Shiki. or Stussy.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:51.040
With this crew of absolute monsters, Rocks’
ultimate goal was to destroy the Celestial

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:56.950
Dragons and become King of the World, but
in the end was defeated by Roger and Garp.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:05:00.830
After the incident at God Valley, Garp became
known as the Hero of the Marines and Roger

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.580
would become pirate king.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.669
Let’s talk about him for a second here.

00:05:04.669 --> 00:05:08.581
Some things we know from Roger’s past are
that he originally owned Luffy’s Straw Hat

00:05:08.581 --> 00:05:12.260
before passing it on to Shanks, who then in
turn passed it down to Luffy.

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:16.910
But most importantly, along with Kozuki Oden
and the rest of the his crew, he was the first

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:21.160
person to ever reach the final island and
find the One Piece.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:25.880
Whatever this treasure was, it must have been
really funny, because Roger burst out laughing

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.910
when he found i.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:29.900
And he decided to name this hidden island
“Laugh Tale.”

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:35.330
For some reason, he had arrived to the treasure
too early, and unfortunately he also had contracted

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:36.400
a deadly disease.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:40.460
So he did everything in his power to ease
so the right person would be able to find

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.860
the island again.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:46.350
After that Roger turned himself in to the
government and announced the existence of

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:52.270
the One Piece to the world, starting the great
pirate era as people scrambled to find Roger’s

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:53.270
treasure.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.840
However before he died, Roger did one more
thing: He had fathered a son with a woman

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.870
named Portgas D. Rouge in secret.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.030
Before his execution, he asked Garp to adopt
his son.

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:08.090
Even though Roger was a pirate and Garp was
a marine, he trusted his longtime rival more

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:13.960
than anyone to see to it that his son had
a chance to live his life despite being related

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.660
to a criminal.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:20.760
Garp agreed to adopt that son, who would go
by the name of Ace and was raised as Luffy’s

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:21.760
brother.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.610
But we’ll get to that in a bit.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:29.120
First we got to back up a little though, because
we just skipped over some massive names: Let’s

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:35.009
talk about the members of the Rocks pirate
crew - 3 of whom would even go on to become

00:06:35.009 --> 00:06:36.550
Emperors of the Sea.

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:40.110
I mean, just look at this picture of Whitebeard
as a kid.

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:44.289
Can you believe that he grew up to become
the world’s strongest man??

00:06:44.289 --> 00:06:47.199
Not to mention he used to have a seriously
nice head of hair.

00:06:47.199 --> 00:06:50.840
It seems that he never did have an actual
beard, though…

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:55.650
Whitebeard grew up on this island, that was
too poor to pay the insanely high taxes to

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:59.830
the world government and therefore had to
defend itself from pirates and bandits on

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.830
its own.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.910
This turned Whitebeard into one of the most
powerful fighters in all of One Piece.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:10.030
And his crew mate Charlotte Lin Lin was this
sweet little girl who didn’t know her own

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:11.030
strength.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:15.199
Her parents abandoned her on Elbaf where her
hunger pangs lead to her absolutely bodying

00:07:15.199 --> 00:07:16.199
some giants.

00:07:16.199 --> 00:07:20.430
Little Hajrudin who we mentioned earlier was
even there as a kid!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:26.240
Fortunately, Mother Carmel was there to raise
Lin Lin in her orphanage.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:31.479
Unfortunately, Mother Carmel was a scam artist
who sold orphans to the World Government.

00:07:31.479 --> 00:07:36.940
Double unfortunately, at the world’s worst
birthday party, Big Mom ate all of her friends

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:43.340
and Mother Carmel alive along with her devil
fruit, gaining her Soul-Soul powers.

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:47.889
After that, Big Mom built her food-related
empire, attracing numerous husbands along

00:07:47.889 --> 00:07:48.889
the way.

00:07:48.889 --> 00:07:52.680
Kaidou was another Rocks pirate with a seriously
messed up childhood.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:57.300
Ever since he was a kid, he was used as a
human weapon due to his immense strength.

00:07:57.300 --> 00:08:01.991
Then after a stint as a government test subject,
he found his way to the Rocks Pirates, where

00:08:01.991 --> 00:08:04.410
Big Mom gave him his dragon devil fruit.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:10.539
As a government test subject, he broke out
a fellow prisoner, Arbor, who he renamed as

00:08:10.539 --> 00:08:11.539
King.

00:08:11.539 --> 00:08:15.370
King is that last known member of the Lunarian
race, a mysterious race with black wings,

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:19.650
dark skin, light hair, and fire-related powers.

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:24.050
King is the one that taught Kaidou about the
myths surrounding Joyboy, which lead Kaidou

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:27.270
to want to set up his base of operations in
Wano.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:32.070
Since the two were being experimented on in
Punk Hazard, this is likely where Kaidou first

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:40.300
encountered Queen as well, since Queen previously
worked with the other scientists of MADS.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.729
Another notable Kaidou crewmate is Who’s
Who.

00:08:42.729 --> 00:08:48.080
This member of the Flying Six used to be a
CP9 agent, until Shanks stole the Gomu Gomu

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:51.160
no Mi that he was responsible for guarding.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:54.910
After this, Who’s Who was imprisoned by
the government but was eventually freed and

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:58.940
became a subordinate of Kaidou, hiding his
identity.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:05.290
Later on, Kaidou would come to encounter Kozuki
Oden in Wano and have the fight of his life.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:10.130
We mentioned Oden a bit earlier since he sailed
together with Roger to Laugh Tale, but we

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:14.970
have got to take a minute to talk about this
Giga Chad’s past.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:18.829
After growing up as a trouble maker, Oden
was named the Daimyo of the lawless land of

00:09:18.829 --> 00:09:21.660
Kuri by his father the Shogun of Wano Country.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:28.390
There he gathered his 9 retainers, the Red
Scabbards - Kinemon, Denjiro, Kawamatsu, Ashura

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:32.590
Doji, Nekomamushi, Inuarashi, Kiku, Raizo,
and Kanjuro.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:36.420
Along with them fought others, though, like
the bewitching Kunoichi Shinobu.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:41.510
However, after a chance meeting with Whitebeard,
Oden went to sea to explore the world outside

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.510
of Wano.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:47.070
While sailing, he met his wife Toki, a time
traveller from the Void Century and they had

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:50.410
their two children Momonosuke and Hiyori.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:55.400
After swapping crews from Whitebeard to Roger,
he went to Laugh Tale and then finally returned

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.270
to Wano with the goal of opening its borders.

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:02.350
Unfortunately, in the time he’d been gone,
Orochi had pulled a power play with the backing

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:05.050
of Kaidou to gain power over Wano.

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:09.520
Orochi, was part of the Kurozumi clan, who
sought to take revenge on the Kozuki clan

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.880
for past conflicts.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:16.640
He even went as far as installing Kanjuro,
another secret Kurozumi, among Oden’s retainers.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:21.790
Finally, though, After a climactic battle,
Kaidou killed Oden while his retainers fled

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:24.040
to the future using Toki’s power.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.920
This sealed Orochi’s position as the shogun
of Wano.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:31.320
This led to terrible times on Wano for the
common people, like Tama.

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:36.320
However, during Luffy’s brother Ace’s
time on Wano, he met Tama and gave her hope

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.320
for the future.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:42.990
While there, Ace also met Yamato, Kaidou’s
son, who was inspired to adopt the name of

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.920
Oden after seeing his bravery during his execution.

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:51.769
Despite being extremely supportive of Yamato’s
gender identity, Kaidou was otherwise a terrible

00:10:51.769 --> 00:10:57.330
father figure, locking him in explosive handcuffs
and confining him to Onigashima for his entire

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.330
life.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:02.700
But now we move from Wano to Egghead where
we finally met the eccentric scientist Dr.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.910
Vegapunk - this genius was inspired to uncover
the secret knowledge of the world after his

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.480
friend and colleague Professor Clover was
killed at Ohara.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:17.649
As the leader of MADS, he also used to work
with other scientists such as Vinsmoke Judge,

00:11:17.649 --> 00:11:19.360
Caesar Clown, and Queen.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:24.149
Of course, while Vegapunk secretly works with
the revolutionaries, he keeps up appearances

00:11:24.149 --> 00:11:26.610
by making technology for the World Government.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.950
So let’s talk about the marine Admirals.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:33.970
We don’t know much about the pasts of the
original three admirals, but Oda has drawn

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.810
them all as children.

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:39.630
Boraslino appears to have always been just
as carefree as he is now.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:44.930
Sakazuki looks to have had a very rough childhood
- I’m willing to bet that his absolute hatred

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.860
of pirates was inspired from a young age.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:54.730
And Kuzan appears to have been extremely disgruntled…and
possibly a victim of childhood alcoholism??

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:58.780
Seriously, why is baby Aokiji carrying that
bottle around?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.480
As for our other admirals, we don’t have
quite as much to go on.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:08.839
We know that Fujitora blinded himself after
seeing terrible atrocities in the world, and

00:12:08.839 --> 00:12:12.070
we’re super curious about what those atrocities
were.

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:17.519
Aramaki, however, is still a mystery.

00:12:17.519 --> 00:12:22.470
And another mysterious character - indeed
one of the most mysterious in the whole series,

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:27.970
is Luffy’s father Dragon, the most wanted
man in the world and leader of the revolutionaries.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:32.149
Recently in Dr. Vegapunk’s flashback, we
learned that the destruction of Ohara is what

00:12:32.149 --> 00:12:38.730
inspired him to join together with Emporio
Ivankov and Bartholomew Kuma to form the Revolutionary

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:39.730
Army.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:43.839
However, it’s still to be seen what traumatic
event caused Dragon to become an absentee

00:12:43.839 --> 00:12:44.839
father.

00:12:44.839 --> 00:12:49.199
It seems to be common in the One Piece world
that just throwing kids in the jungle is the

00:12:49.199 --> 00:12:50.920
equivalent of daycare.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:56.420
Of course, having the parent present isn’t
*always* a good thing…Like for Big Mom’s

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.390
many, many traumatized children.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:02.920
At age 50, Perospero is the eldest son of
Big Mom, followed by the triplets Katakuri,

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.149
Oven, and Daifuku.

00:13:04.149 --> 00:13:08.959
We don’t have full backstories on all of
the Charlotte Family - the most detail we

00:13:08.959 --> 00:13:12.730
get is from Katakuri, Brulee, and Pudding.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:17.110
Katakuri’s other siblings would make fun
of his huge donut-eating mouth, calling him

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.110
a “pelican eel.”

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:23.800
Why they went with this obscure deep-sea creature
instead of just calling him a pelican is a

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:24.800
mystery.&nbsp;

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:29.260
After Katakuri beat them up in response, his
brothers took their revenge out on Brulee,

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.589
scarring her face.

00:13:30.589 --> 00:13:33.490
Afterward, Katakuri began covering up his
mouth.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:38.320
In his mind, he was doing it to protect his
siblings as well as cultivating a serious

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:39.320
image.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:44.110
Pudding, on the other hand, spent her entire
childhood being ridiculed for her third eye,

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:47.079
even being called hideous by her own mother.

00:13:47.079 --> 00:13:51.240
The Charlottes are not what you would call
a loving and supportive family.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.139
Now for the Shichibukai.&nbsp;

00:13:53.139 --> 00:13:54.690
Gekko Moria.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:59.660
Moria was once an idealistic young pirate
with his sights set on rising to the top of

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.000
the pirate world.

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:06.269
However, after challenging Kaidou, his entire
crew was mercilessly killed.

00:14:06.269 --> 00:14:11.860
Him losing his entire crew is what would inspire
him to use a zombie army in the future - he

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:15.720
can’t lose his crew and relive that pain
if they’re already dead.

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:20.550
To replace his old crew, he gathered followers
like Hogback, a skilled surgeon with a twisted

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:21.589
reputation.

00:14:21.589 --> 00:14:26.850
Hogback helped Moria stitch his zombies together,
including Cindry - who was a famous stage

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:31.329
actress in life that was resurrected as a
zombie by the mad scientist.

00:14:31.329 --> 00:14:36.170
Absalom, another crew member, had his face
partially spliced with a lion, to better resemble

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.800
the predator he is.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:44.220
As we can see from this drawing, though, Perona
has been goth since day one: it’s NOT just

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.240
a phase.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:50.160
Bartholomew Kuma, another warlord we encountered
on Thriller Bark, was known as a tyrant and

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.089
served as the ruler of the Sorbet Kingdom.

00:14:52.089 --> 00:14:54.089
Hes also Jewelrey Bonney’s father.

00:14:54.089 --> 00:14:59.170
He was also a prominent member of the Revolutionary
Army, but was converted by Dr. Vegapunk into

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.579
a cyborg in service of the World Government.

00:15:01.579 --> 00:15:11.839
Kuma’s was also used as the basis for the
Pacifista robots.

00:15:11.839 --> 00:15:14.949
Crocodile was the first warlord that Luffy
defeated.

00:15:14.949 --> 00:15:19.360
We can’t tell a whole lot about Crocodile’s
past, but we do know that he has a grudge

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.360
against Whitebeard.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:25.910
In addition, we know he has a deep dark secret
that only Emporio Ivankov knows.

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:29.920
While working with Nico Robin, his organization
Baroque Works decided to try and steal the

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:35.110
throne of Alabasta while Crocodile secretly
sought the Ancient Weapon Pluton.

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:42.910
Crocodile 
plotted against Nefertari Cobra, the beloved

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.819
ruler of the desert island Alabasta.

00:15:44.819 --> 00:15:49.860
His daughter, Princess Vivi, is even an honorary
Straw Hat after their travels together.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:53.720
As one of the original fourty kingdoms that
founded the World Government, the Nefertaris

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.670
regularly attend the Reverie.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:16:00.649
As a child there, Vivi encountered Wapol,
the monarch of the Drum Kingdom, who showed

00:16:00.649 --> 00:16:04.089
his true colors by slapping her while she
was a child.

00:16:04.089 --> 00:16:09.029
In Alabasta, Vivi also grew up as a close
friend of Koza, who would eventually lead

00:16:09.029 --> 00:16:12.339
the rebel army fueled by Crocodile’s lies
and deceit.

00:16:12.339 --> 00:16:16.160
As children, Vivi joined Koza’s Suna Suna
Club.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.190
These brave kids once actually saved Vivi’s
life from kidnappers.

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:24.670
Jinbe, the Knight of the Sea, and current
Straw Hat pirate got his start on the Sun

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.319
Pirates under Fisher Tiger.

00:16:27.319 --> 00:16:30.259
Fisher Tiger was once enslaved by the Celestial
Dragons.

00:16:30.259 --> 00:16:35.459
After his escape, he single handedly scaled
the red line back to Mariejois and released

00:16:35.459 --> 00:16:39.930
the rest of the slaves there in a legendary
one man assault against the World Government’s

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:40.930
capital.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.240
The sun pirates adopted a sun symbol brand
to cover up the Celestial Dragon’s brand

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:48.010
that they were marked with.

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:51.740
All members of the crew received a sun brand
so that people couldn’t differentiate who

00:16:51.740 --> 00:17:00.779
was a former slave and who was not.

00:17:00.779 --> 00:17:05.770
The Sun Pirates escorted a former slave, who
would grow up to be the Revolutionary, Koala

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:06.770
back home.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:10.900
However, they were attacked by a squad of
marines and Fisher Tiger was shot.

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:14.410
Eventually, Fisher Tiger died, needing a blood
transfusion.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:18.799
Due to his hatred of humans, he couldn’t
let himself receive blood from a human and

00:17:18.799 --> 00:17:20.089
passed away.

00:17:20.089 --> 00:17:23.880
Afterward Jinbe and Arlong fought for leadership
of the Sun Pirates.

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:28.350
Jinbe gained control of the crew, eventually
becoming a Shichibukai in order to better

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:31.299
the terms between the government and Fishman
Island.

00:17:31.299 --> 00:17:36.480
Arlong, meanwhile, formed his own Arlong Pirates
and moved to the East Blue where he constructed

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.480
Arlong Park.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.340
Not a lot is known about Dracule Mihawk’s
past, either.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:45.650
We know he was a long time rival and friend
of Shanks, at least until Shanks lost his

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:46.650
arm.

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:52.190
We also know that before becoming a Shichibukai,
he was known as the Marine Hunter.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:56.330
Another former warlord, Donquixote Doflamingo,
is a Celestial Dragon.

00:17:56.330 --> 00:18:02.250
After his father left his position as a Celestial
Dragon, they moved to the sea only to be met

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:05.700
with hatred and persecution by the people
there.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:10.309
Eventually Doflamingo killed his own father,
but it was too late to regain his position

00:18:10.309 --> 00:18:11.669
in Mariejois.

00:18:11.669 --> 00:18:16.210
After being taken in by Trebol, the young
Doflamingo began on his path to becoming an

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.510
infamous pirate.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:23.409
Eventually, he claimed the Kingdom of Dressrosa,
the Donquixote family’s ancestral home,

00:18:23.409 --> 00:18:24.850
as his own.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:29.669
Before Doflamingo’s invasion, Dressrosa
was a peaceful kingdom led by the kind King

00:18:29.669 --> 00:18:30.669
Riku.

00:18:30.669 --> 00:18:34.840
Kyros, a legendary gladiator who became captain
of the royal guard even married King Riku’s

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.810
daughter and the two had their own daughter
together named Princess Rebecca.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:43.890
The family lived happily until Doflamingo
used his string powers to manipulate Riku,

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.390
causing him to cut down his own citizens.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:51.150
Kyros made a stand against the Donquixote
Pirates, but one of Doflamingo’s subordinates

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:55.930
named Sugar used her devil fruit power to
turn Kyros into a toy soldier.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:19:00.710
A side effect of of this power was that everyone
forgot that Kyros had ever existed.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:05.620
The toy soldier version of Kyros still helped
raise Rebecca, teaching her how to defend

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:11.150
herself as Riku and Rebecca were forced to
compete in Dressrosa’s Coliseum for their

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:15.070
own survival and the Donquixote family’s
entertainment.Another set of Oda’s drawings

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:19.340
from the SBS sections of the manga treat us
to some of the Donquixote family members as

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.450
children.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:26.210
We can see that Trebol has always been disgusting
and also see a young Diamante, Pica, Lao G,

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:28.280
Machvise, Giolla, Gladius, and Monet.

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:35.250
Of course, the Donquixote Family member with
the most fleshed out backstory is noneother

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.250
than Senor Pink.

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:41.380
Senor Pink’s backstory came seemingly out
of nowhere, but managed to tug on fan’s

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:44.640
heart strings and is considered among the
best in the series.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.169
Long ago, Senor Pink fell in love with a woman
named Russian.

00:19:48.169 --> 00:19:52.990
Together, they had a child named Gimlet, but
all along, Russian didn’t know that her

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:56.290
husband was part of a crime family and a pirate.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.240
Unfortunately, Gimlet passed away as an infant
from illness and afterward Russian learned

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:05.100
the truth behind Senor Pink - she ran away
but was caught in a landslide, causing her

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.390
to fall into a vegatative state.

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:11.741
Senor Pink would visit her each day in the
hospital, and one day put on Gimlet’s baby

00:20:11.741 --> 00:20:15.120
bonnet while expressing grief over their son.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:21.010
She reacted by smiling despite her coma, which
lead to Pink dressing more and more like a

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:24.030
baby to get a reaction from his beloved wife.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.840
Senor Pink still dresses as a baby to this
day.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:29.500
It’s just a hardboiled thing to do.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.500
But while Doflamingo was a Celestial Dragon,
our next Shichibukai was a victim of the Celestial

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.500
Dragons.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:40.150
Boa Hancock, the Empress of Amazon Lily, was
enslaved by the Celestial Dragons as a child

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:41.460
along with her sisters.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:46.500
However, she was set free during Fisher Tiger’s
attack on Mariejois.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:50.740
Hancock has also known Silvers Rayleigh for
a long time given that Rayleigh’s spouse

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:53.670
Shakky was the former empress of Amazon Lily.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:58.610
Later on, she became a Shichibukai in order
to protect Amazon Lily from the government.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:04.409
Blackbeard, or Marshall D. Teach, also had
a childhood as we can tell from this childhood

00:21:04.409 --> 00:21:05.450
drawing from Oda.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.940
We see him here crying under a crescent moon.

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:13.159
As a young boy, he was taken in by Whitebeard
and people quickly noticed his peculiar traits,

00:21:13.159 --> 00:21:16.039
such as the fact that he never sleeps.

00:21:16.039 --> 00:21:20.730
We still have a lot to learn about his past,
but since his ship’s name was the Saber

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:26.220
of Xebec, it’s clear that he was somehow
inspired by Rocks.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:29.309
His crewmates are also notorious in their
own right.

00:21:29.309 --> 00:21:35.019
We don’t know much about the pasts of Jesus
Burgess, Doc Q, or Van Auger, but Lafitte

00:21:35.019 --> 00:21:38.570
was a former police officer - talk about a
crooked cop.

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:42.640
Blackbeard’s other crewmates were recruited
from Impel Down, which means that characters

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:49.380
like Catarina Devon, Vasco Shot, Sanjuan Wolf,
and Avalo Pizzaro all have lengthy criminal

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.380
records.

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:55.260
Shiryu, on the other hand, wasn’t just a
prisoner of Impel Down - he was a former jailer

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:59.140
who was so cruel to the inmates that they
had to imprison him as well.

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:04.110
As a child when the Whitebeard and Roger pirates
met, Blackbeard also met a young Shanks.

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:08.779
Shanks was found by Roger in a treasure chest
at God Valley and was then adopted by the

00:22:08.779 --> 00:22:09.830
crew.

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:15.070
Shanks became a cabin boy along with Buggy
- both of whom would grow up to become Yonkou.

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.510
While aboard Roger’s ship, Buggy accidentally
consumed the Chop-Chop fruit, gaining his

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:20.560
devil fruit powers.

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:25.340
Before Roger’s execution, Shanks inherited
his captain’s Straw Hat and one day he would

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.179
give the hat to Luffy.

00:22:27.179 --> 00:22:31.990
Some time after Roger’s death, Shanks stole
the Gomu Gomu no Mi from the marines, which

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:33.360
Luffy would eventually eat.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:38.909
And now we move back to ancient history for
the oldest flashback chronologically in the

00:22:38.909 --> 00:22:43.150
series so far where we learn about Kalgara
and Montblanc Noland.

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:47.799
Montblanc Noland, also known as Noland the
liar, was a famous explorer.

00:22:47.799 --> 00:22:53.140
He befriended the dwarves of Green Bit, but
also traveled to Jaya where he met the Shandians

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.770
and saw the City of Gold.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:57.890
While there, he befriended the Shandian Warrior
Kalgara.

00:22:57.890 --> 00:23:03.169
He promised to return one day, but by the
time he returned, Shandora had been sent up

00:23:03.169 --> 00:23:09.510
to Skypiea by the Knock-Up Stream, and Noland
was remembered by history as a great liar.

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.690
In the present day story, Skypiea would be
conquered by Eneru.

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:18.299
Strangely, Eneru and his crewmates were not
from Skypiea, but another Sky Island called

00:23:18.299 --> 00:23:19.299
Birka.

00:23:19.299 --> 00:23:23.700
After he gained his lightning powers, he destroyed
Birka without a second thought and eventually

00:23:23.700 --> 00:23:27.460
wound up on Skypiea and declared himself as
God.

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.930
Mad Monk Urouge, another sky islander, is
one of the Supernovas.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:35.760
We don’t know much about his backstory yet,
but we do have this drawing of him where he’s

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.240
sporting the traditional skypiean hairstyle.

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:44.330
We can only hope that when he returns to the
series, he brings this look back.

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:49.460
Capone Bege was known as a famous mafioso
in the West Blue before entering the Grand

00:23:49.460 --> 00:23:54.330
Line - and according to this picture, he loved
playing with blocks as a kid - building the

00:23:54.330 --> 00:23:58.050
castles that he would eventually become.

00:23:58.050 --> 00:24:00.970
X-Drake had quite different ambitions.

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:06.000
He didn’t want to become a pirate - instead
he dreamed of becoming a marine, a dream that

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:11.059
would come true when he grew up to be a member
of SWORD.

00:24:11.059 --> 00:24:15.980
Basil Hawkins, God rest his soul, got his
practice as a tarot card reader very early.

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:23.090
And Scratchmen Apoo got in plenty of piano
lessons before his teeth became a keyboard.

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:27.230
Taking a detour from the Supernovas, though,
we have our very own Cyborg Franky.

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:32.610
He was born with the name Cutty Flam, which
explains why he’d want to undergo a change

00:24:32.610 --> 00:24:35.290
to the much cooler “Franky.”

00:24:35.290 --> 00:24:39.740
He was abandoned by his pirate parents and
grew up on the island of shipwrights, Water

00:24:39.740 --> 00:24:40.740
7.

00:24:40.740 --> 00:24:45.360
As a young inventor, Franky constructed numerous
battleships he named “Battle Frankys.”

00:24:45.360 --> 00:24:50.640
He and the future mayor, Iceburg, were raised
by the legendary shipwright Tom who constructed

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:53.270
Gol D. Roger’s ship, the Oro Jackson.

00:24:53.270 --> 00:24:58.500
In fact, during Roger and Oden’s voyage,
they visited Tom and Oden even invited a young

00:24:58.500 --> 00:25:00.809
Franky to join their crew.

00:25:00.809 --> 00:25:06.510
However, Franky refused because he hated pirates
on account of having been abandoned by them.

00:25:06.510 --> 00:25:12.360
Another parental figure to Franky was Kokoro,
a secret mermaid and secretary to Tom.

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:16.190
Later in his life, Tom was put on trial for
constructing the Oro Jackson.

00:25:16.190 --> 00:25:20.670
To avoid execution, he agreed to build the
Sea Train for the government.

00:25:20.670 --> 00:25:24.710
After construction was completed, in a plot
to acquire the blueprints to the Ancient Weapon

00:25:24.710 --> 00:25:30.970
Pluton, CP9’s Spandam used Franky’s battleships
to stage an attack on Water 7.

00:25:30.970 --> 00:25:34.380
Tom received the blame for the attack and
was sentenced to death.

00:25:34.380 --> 00:25:39.789
In an effort to stop CP9, Franky hit Spandam’s
face with a rifle, permanently scarring him.

00:25:39.789 --> 00:25:44.539
He also stood in the way of the Sea Train
in an effort to stop it from taking Tom to

00:25:44.539 --> 00:25:48.710
Enies Lobby, which horribly wounded Franky.

00:25:48.710 --> 00:25:55.290
However, Franky was able to rebuild himself
into the cyborg we know and love today.

00:25:55.290 --> 00:25:59.330
Speaking of Spandam, though, he started in
the family espionage business early, following

00:25:59.330 --> 00:26:01.760
in the footsteps of his father, Spandine.

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:07.230
He and the rest of the CP9 members from the
Enies Lobby arc are also pictured as kids.

00:26:07.230 --> 00:26:11.990
Confusingly, Spandam’s pictured with a young
elephant, which is strange because Funkfreed

00:26:11.990 --> 00:26:14.620
was a sword that ate an elephant fruit.

00:26:14.620 --> 00:26:20.270
We can only guess that he received his unique
sword at a very young age.

00:26:20.270 --> 00:26:25.279
The various CP9 members - Jabra, Kumadori,
Blueno, Fukuro, Kalifa, Kaku, and Lucci were

00:26:25.279 --> 00:26:28.679
all trained as government spies and assassins
from childhood.

00:26:28.679 --> 00:26:31.730
The one we know most about, of course, is
Rob Lucci.

00:26:31.730 --> 00:26:37.140
Apparently, he’s known his pigeon Hattori
since he was very young, which begs the question:

00:26:37.140 --> 00:26:40.720
how long do pigeons live in the One Piece
world?

00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:46.190
Lucci was made famous in an operation he conducted
at the age of 13 where he mercilessly killed

00:26:46.190 --> 00:26:50.880
500 soldier hostages along with the pirates
who were holding them.

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:55.530
This proved his savage brand of dark justice
to the World Government and made him one of

00:26:55.530 --> 00:26:57.190
their deadliest assets.

00:26:57.190 --> 00:26:58.950
Lucci is a fan favorite villain

00:26:58.950 --> 00:27:03.030
And Hody Jones…is not.

00:27:03.030 --> 00:27:07.980
Hody Jones was the captain of the New Fish-Man
pirates and served as the main antagonist

00:27:07.980 --> 00:27:09.320
of the Fish-Man Island Arc.

00:27:09.320 --> 00:27:13.950
He once served as a soldier in King Neptune’s
army, during Queen Orohime’s reign.

00:27:13.950 --> 00:27:18.809
Queen Orohime was a ruler who promoted peace
between the races, despite the persecution

00:27:18.809 --> 00:27:21.659
fishmen had faced at the hands of humans.

00:27:21.659 --> 00:27:26.470
Her daughter, Shirahoshi, was revealed to
be Poseidon - a member of the Fishman royal

00:27:26.470 --> 00:27:29.470
family with the power to command the Sea Kings.

00:27:29.470 --> 00:27:34.100
Vander Decken, one of Hody Jones’ allies,
touched Shirahoshi as a child using his mark-mark

00:27:34.100 --> 00:27:35.100
fruit power.

00:27:35.100 --> 00:27:45.039
This allowed him to throw objects and weapons
at her from anywhere, which forced her to

00:27:45.039 --> 00:27:50.299
live most of her life in isolation within&nbsp;
Ryugu Kingdom’s castle, protected from random

00:27:50.299 --> 00:27:52.110
flying axes.

00:27:52.110 --> 00:27:58.210
Due to his hatred of humans, Hody Jones assassinated
Queen Orohime to create conflict between between

00:27:58.210 --> 00:27:59.210
the races.

00:27:59.210 --> 00:28:04.860
Inspired by Arlong, he founded the New Fish-Man
pirates with the goal of taking over Fishman

00:28:04.860 --> 00:28:08.860
Island and eventually waging war against humans
on the surface.

00:28:08.860 --> 00:28:13.590
Using the power of the Energy Steroids from
the Tamate Bako Box treasure, he and his crew

00:28:13.590 --> 00:28:18.710
mates gained incredible power that allowed
them to almost take over Fish Man Island.

00:28:18.710 --> 00:28:22.700
They just didn’t count on those meddling
Straw Hats showing up.

00:28:22.700 --> 00:28:27.659
Our next Straw Hat crew member is Nico Robin,
who like the rest of her crewmates has an

00:28:27.659 --> 00:28:30.059
extremely tragic backstory.

00:28:30.059 --> 00:28:32.649
Robin grew up on Ohara, the island of scholars.

00:28:32.649 --> 00:28:36.690
Professor Clover and the other researchers
had uncovered the mysteries of the Void Century,

00:28:36.690 --> 00:28:41.080
the Ancient Kingdom, and the language written
on the Poneglyphs - unbreakable blocks spread

00:28:41.080 --> 00:28:44.429
around the world that carry forgotten historical
truths.

00:28:44.429 --> 00:28:48.690
One day, a giant marine named Jaguar D. Saul
washed ashore and befriended Robin.

00:28:48.690 --> 00:28:52.750
He warned her that the marines were coming
to attack Ohara to destroy and cover up the

00:28:52.750 --> 00:28:55.770
knowledge that the scholars had uncovered.

00:28:55.770 --> 00:29:05.779
Robin’s mother, Nico Olvia, also returned
to the island, but her, Professor Clover,

00:29:05.779 --> 00:29:09.780
and all of the other residents of Ohara were
killed by the marines.

00:29:09.780 --> 00:29:15.799
Admiral Aokiji allowed Robin to escape, making
her the sole survivor of the island.

00:29:15.799 --> 00:29:20.340
In order to make a living, she ended up joining
with various pirates, eventually becoming

00:29:20.340 --> 00:29:22.240
Sir Crocodile’s second in command.

00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:28.289
She made it her goal to seek out the poneglyphs
and learn the truth behind the history of

00:29:28.289 --> 00:29:29.370
the world.

00:29:29.370 --> 00:29:35.159
Pedro, a jaguar mink who accompanied Luffy
to Whole Cake Island was once the captain

00:29:35.159 --> 00:29:36.730
of the Nox pirates.

00:29:36.730 --> 00:29:40.309
This group of minks made it their goal to
search for those same poneglyphs.

00:29:40.309 --> 00:29:45.940
However, on a mission to Big Mom’s territory
many years ago, he and his comrade Zepo, who

00:29:45.940 --> 00:29:47.740
is Bepo’s brother, were captured.

00:29:47.740 --> 00:29:52.830
Zepo was killed, but Big Mom spared Pedro
after he tore out his own eye in exchange

00:29:52.830 --> 00:29:55.190
for her sparing a few years of his life.

00:29:55.190 --> 00:29:59.669
He did so because he wanted to be alive to
see the “Dawn of the World.”

00:29:59.669 --> 00:30:04.870
Eustass Kid, a supernova and a chief rival
to Luffy, was born on a lawless island in

00:30:04.870 --> 00:30:05.990
the South Blue.

00:30:05.990 --> 00:30:10.679
Interestingly, his backstory was given to
us almost entirely through Oda’s SBS section

00:30:10.679 --> 00:30:13.419
of the manga volumes.

00:30:13.419 --> 00:30:17.120
On his island, there were four gang leaders,
two of whom were Kid and Killer.

00:30:17.120 --> 00:30:20.790
Despite being rival gang leaders, the two
were great friends and also had a crush on

00:30:20.790 --> 00:30:22.210
the same girl: Victoria.

00:30:22.210 --> 00:30:27.169
However, when a criminal organization killed
Victoria, Kid and Killer united the gangs

00:30:27.169 --> 00:30:29.340
of the island to take revenge.

00:30:29.340 --> 00:30:33.580
Their alliance would eventually become the
Kid Pirates, ending with them setting sail

00:30:33.580 --> 00:30:34.779
and entering the Grand Line.

00:30:34.779 --> 00:30:39.620
During the time skip, Kid as well as his allies
Hawkins and Apoo even challenged Red-Haired

00:30:39.620 --> 00:30:42.230
Shanks, which resulted in Kid losing an arm.

00:30:42.230 --> 00:30:47.610
So that makes two one armed red-haired characters
in the series.

00:30:47.610 --> 00:30:52.210
Trafalgar Law, a fellow supernova and chief
rival of Kid and Luffy,&nbsp; is the sole survivor

00:30:52.210 --> 00:30:54.809
of an island in the North Blue called Flevance.

00:30:54.809 --> 00:31:00.760
Flevance was known as the “White City”
due to its industry of mining Amber Lead.

00:31:00.760 --> 00:31:04.820
However, exposure to this substance had horrible
consequences.

00:31:04.820 --> 00:31:09.399
The terrible Amber Lead disease plagued the
people of Flevance and the World Government

00:31:09.399 --> 00:31:14.470
murdered everyone who lived there as a way
of preventing the disease’s spread - and

00:31:14.470 --> 00:31:19.270
what makes it even more tragic is that the
disease wasn’t even contagious.

00:31:19.270 --> 00:31:23.711
Law only survived by hiding within a pile
of dead bodies that was being carted out of

00:31:23.711 --> 00:31:24.830
the city.

00:31:24.830 --> 00:31:28.120
After his escape from Flevance, Law joined
the Donquixote Pirates.

00:31:28.120 --> 00:31:32.090
Surprisingly, Law wasn’t the only kid hanging
around Doflamingo.

00:31:32.090 --> 00:31:36.620
He befriended two other crew members close
to his age - Baby 5 and Buffalo.

00:31:36.620 --> 00:31:40.639
We don’t know much about Buffalo’s past,
but Baby 5 has her own sad backstory.

00:31:40.639 --> 00:31:43.559
Baby 5 was abandoned by her mother who saw
her as useless.

00:31:43.559 --> 00:31:47.929
It’s thought that she’s called Baby 5
because she was literally her mother’s 5th

00:31:47.929 --> 00:31:53.309
baby - her mom didn’t even care enough about
her to give her an actual name: just a number.

00:31:53.309 --> 00:31:57.320
To this day, she’s obsessed with serving
others and clings to anyone who shows her

00:31:57.320 --> 00:31:59.100
the smallest bit of kindness.

00:31:59.100 --> 00:32:04.710
Like many things in One Piece, it’s played
off as a joke, but is actual unsettling and

00:32:04.710 --> 00:32:07.510
heartbreaking when you really think about
it.

00:32:07.510 --> 00:32:11.490
However, Trafalgar Law had one person in his
life he was much closer to than the other

00:32:11.490 --> 00:32:13.090
kids his age.

00:32:13.090 --> 00:32:18.600
He befriended Doflamingo’s brother, Rocinante
or “Corazon” - who was a secret marine

00:32:18.600 --> 00:32:21.130
plotting against his brother’s rise to power.

00:32:21.130 --> 00:32:25.010
Knowing that Law’s Amber Lead disease could
be cured by a devil fruit called the Ope Ope

00:32:25.010 --> 00:32:28.210
no Mi, Doflamingo made plans to steal the
fruit.

00:32:28.210 --> 00:32:33.750
However, Doflamingo secretly wanted Law to
eat the fruit so that he could use its immortality

00:32:33.750 --> 00:32:36.840
surgery power to grant Doflamingo eternal
life.

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:43.100
Corazon made a plan to steal the fruit for
Law first and succeeded, but at the cost of

00:32:43.100 --> 00:32:44.100
his own life.

00:32:44.100 --> 00:32:49.169
Law narrowly avoided being recaptured by the
Doflamingo pirates and eventually met Bepo,

00:32:49.169 --> 00:32:55.049
Shachi, and Penguin, starting the Heart Pirates
with the goal of eventually taking down Doflamingo.

00:32:55.049 --> 00:32:59.980
Cavendish, the captain of the Beautiful Pirates,
was an up and coming superstar in the pirate

00:32:59.980 --> 00:33:00.980
world.

00:33:00.980 --> 00:33:04.919
However, after the Worst Generation made their
debut, Straw Hat Luffy and his contemporaries

00:33:04.919 --> 00:33:08.430
stole the spotlight causing Cavendish to hold
a grudge.

00:33:08.430 --> 00:33:12.240
Funny, then, that he ended up in Luffy’s
Grand Fleet.

00:33:12.240 --> 00:33:17.470
Cavendish is also possessed by a demon or
curse called Hakuba that takes over his body

00:33:17.470 --> 00:33:23.320
when he falls asleep - still no word on how
he ended up with this affliction, but we can

00:33:23.320 --> 00:33:27.000
guess it has something to do with his cursed
sword, Durandal.

00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:32.020
Bartolomeo was another Corrida Coliseum contender,
who unlike Cavendish wants nothing more than

00:33:32.020 --> 00:33:33.810
to be working under Luffy.

00:33:33.810 --> 00:33:38.130
Ever since he saw Luffy’s failed execution
in Logue Town at the hands of Buggy, Bartolomeo

00:33:38.130 --> 00:33:41.630
has been the number one Straw Hat super fan.

00:33:41.630 --> 00:33:46.529
As head of the Barto Club, he’s collected
every bounty poster and followed every piece

00:33:46.529 --> 00:33:52.809
of news throughout Luffy’s journey, forming
an entire pirate crew out of Straw Hat fans.

00:33:52.809 --> 00:33:57.080
He competed in the Corrida Coliseum in order
to win the Mera-Mera no Mi back for Luffy

00:33:57.080 --> 00:34:00.830
and ended up meeting his idols in the process.

00:34:00.830 --> 00:34:06.670
Duval, the head of the Rosy Life Riders, was
born into terrible circumstances.

00:34:06.670 --> 00:34:12.149
Namely, his face looked exactly like the Marines’
terrible Sanji drawing on this wanted poster.

00:34:12.149 --> 00:34:16.360
Being mistaken for Black Leg Sanji led to
Duval living life on the run and constantly

00:34:16.360 --> 00:34:18.629
wearing a helmet to hide his identity.

00:34:18.629 --> 00:34:23.720
Thankfully, Sanji kicked his face into a new
handsome shape causing him to turn his life

00:34:23.720 --> 00:34:25.790
around.

00:34:25.790 --> 00:34:31.859
Jewelry Bonney is another one of the Supernova
who according to this childhood drawing has

00:34:31.859 --> 00:34:34.339
always had a healthy appetite.

00:34:34.339 --> 00:34:41.429
Bonney is also the princess of the Sorbet
Kingdom since she is Kuma’s daughter.

00:34:41.429 --> 00:34:46.000
Ace and Sabo, Luffy’s adoptive brothers,
both grew up in the Goa Kingdom, but under

00:34:46.000 --> 00:34:48.099
very different circumstances.

00:34:48.099 --> 00:34:53.079
Ace was born the son of the Pirate King, but
to protect Ace, Monkey D. Garp raised him

00:34:53.079 --> 00:34:55.640
as his own grandson and hid his true parentage.

00:34:55.640 --> 00:35:00.339
Sabo, however, was the son of a noble who
longed for freedom outside of the niceties

00:35:00.339 --> 00:35:01.829
of upper class life.

00:35:01.829 --> 00:35:06.520
And one thing in Sabo’s life was even worse
to deal with than the unbearable customs of

00:35:06.520 --> 00:35:11.089
nobility: his adopted brother Sterry, who
would eventually become the ruler of the Goa

00:35:11.089 --> 00:35:15.660
Kingdom and who has one of the most punchable
faces in all of One Piece.

00:35:15.660 --> 00:35:19.690
Ace and Sabo, along with their younger brother
Luffy, adventured in the jungles of their

00:35:19.690 --> 00:35:23.290
home island and dreamed of setting sail as
pirates together.

00:35:23.290 --> 00:35:27.210
But everything changed when a Celestial Dragon
was scheduled to visit the kingdom.

00:35:27.210 --> 00:35:32.360
You see, the Goa Kingdom is home to an enormous
class divide.

00:35:32.360 --> 00:35:36.670
The poor people of this society were forced
to live in a massive junkyard known as Gray

00:35:36.670 --> 00:35:39.790
Terminal and lived off of the scraps of the
nobles.

00:35:39.790 --> 00:35:43.920
In order to avoid letting the Celestial Dragon
lay eyes on these impoverished people, the

00:35:43.920 --> 00:35:48.680
nobles conspired to burn the Gray Terminal
and all the people in it.

00:35:48.680 --> 00:35:53.740
Sabo escaped Goa and set sail with the goal
of becoming a pirate, but his makeshift vessel

00:35:53.740 --> 00:35:58.410
was shot down by the Celestial Dragons and
he was mortally wounded.

00:35:58.410 --> 00:36:02.900
Thankfully, Monkey D. Dragon and his revolutionaries
happened to find the amnesiac Sabo.

00:36:02.900 --> 00:36:07.550
Not knowing that Sabo was a brother of his
biological son, Luffy, Dragon raised him and

00:36:07.550 --> 00:36:11.410
Sabo eventually became the second in command
of the revolutionary army.

00:36:11.410 --> 00:36:16.400
Ace on the other hand grew up to become a
famous pirate in his own right, becoming Whitebeard’s

00:36:16.400 --> 00:36:17.460
fourth division commander.

00:36:17.460 --> 00:36:22.180
In fact, Whitebeard believed that Ace would
become the king of the pirates one day.

00:36:22.180 --> 00:36:25.349
Unfortunately after Blackbeard killed one
of the fellow division commanders in order

00:36:25.349 --> 00:36:29.790
to steal the darkness fruit, Ace set off in
pursuit, which would eventually result in

00:36:29.790 --> 00:36:31.160
his defeat and capture.

00:36:31.160 --> 00:36:35.350
Roronoa Zoro, the swordsman of the Straw Hat
crew, grew up in Shimotsuki Village and is

00:36:35.350 --> 00:36:39.940
descended from the samurai that fled Wano
Country after Orochi’s takeover.

00:36:39.940 --> 00:36:44.010
As a kid, he trained hard to overtake his
rival Kuina at swordsmanship.

00:36:44.010 --> 00:36:47.790
However, after her death at a young age, he
swore that he would achieve their dream of

00:36:47.790 --> 00:36:50.290
becoming the world’s strongest swordsman.

00:36:50.290 --> 00:36:54.540
Sanji actually gets two backstories for the
price of one.

00:36:54.540 --> 00:36:58.250
Originally as a prince of the Germa Kingdom,
he was the result of experimentation by his

00:36:58.250 --> 00:36:59.400
father Vinsmoke Judge.

00:36:59.400 --> 00:37:03.640
His siblings, who had been deprived of their
emotions, tormented him mercilessly.

00:37:03.640 --> 00:37:08.569
Finally, after he was freed from the cruelty
of the Vinsmokes he found himself in the East

00:37:08.569 --> 00:37:09.569
Blue.

00:37:09.569 --> 00:37:12.070
While in the East Blue, he was working on
a ship as a cook.

00:37:12.070 --> 00:37:16.609
He was endlessly teased for his dream of finding
the All Blue, a sea that brought together

00:37:16.609 --> 00:37:19.520
fish from all parts of the world - a chef’s
dream.

00:37:19.520 --> 00:37:24.329
The ship was attacked by pirates, but when
a terrible storm nearly drowned Sanji, the

00:37:24.329 --> 00:37:26.130
pirate captain Zeff saved him.

00:37:26.130 --> 00:37:31.540
Zeff saved Sanji because he’d overheard
his dream and also believed in the All Blue.

00:37:31.540 --> 00:37:34.550
After the shipwreck, the pair were deserted
on a small island.

00:37:34.550 --> 00:37:38.670
Zeff separated all the food they had into
two portions and divided the island in half

00:37:38.670 --> 00:37:41.849
so that each of them could serve as a look
out in opposite directions.

00:37:41.849 --> 00:37:45.830
Soon, Sanji’s rations were depleted and
he began to starve.

00:37:45.830 --> 00:37:50.140
When he noticed that Zeff’s food bag was
still nearly full, he attempted to steal the

00:37:50.140 --> 00:37:54.910
old man’s food, only to realize the bag
was full of treasure.

00:37:54.910 --> 00:38:00.290
Zeff had given Sanji all of the food and had
only survived by eating his own leg.

00:38:00.290 --> 00:38:04.550
Finally the two were rescued and they founded
Baratie, the floating restaurant.Nami and

00:38:04.550 --> 00:38:08.780
her sister Nojiko were both found as babies
by a Marine named Bellemere.

00:38:08.780 --> 00:38:12.390
They grew up peacefully in Cocoyasi Village,
but everything changed when Arlong decided

00:38:12.390 --> 00:38:14.690
to make it his base of operations.

00:38:14.690 --> 00:38:19.319
Arlong and his underlings Hatchan, Chew, and
Kuroobi had left the Sun Pirates to form their

00:38:19.319 --> 00:38:20.319
own crew.

00:38:20.319 --> 00:38:25.050
Arlong believed in Fishmen’s supremacy over
humans and built Arlong Park as his own twisted

00:38:25.050 --> 00:38:29.730
parallel to Sabaody Park, a place where he
and his fellow fishmen were never allowed

00:38:29.730 --> 00:40:31.660
to enter 

00:40:31.660 --> 00:41:40.829
as children.

